  "_comment": "Shared cases for the extension-app record aggregation (#2162). Read by shared/tests/appRecordAggregation.test.ts, and by the MCP copy's suite once #2163 adds it, so the Analytics records tab and the list_records tool are held to the same answers. Week keys are the Goals week keys (Sunday start, D-20260816-briefing-1). Each point carries its instant (occurredAt, epoch ms at or after noon JST on its dateKey, so list_records can store it as is) and an id; latest is the newest instant, the larger id on a tie (#2259). Values are exactly representable in binary so every sum is exact.",
